    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41364" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτίμ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>castigation, censure, criticism,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.48
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				258
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1355a24
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτίμησιν ἐπιτιμᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1340b40
				</span></i>
			 : pl., <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>enhancement in price,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίτου</span>”
