					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					4.117
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Rhet.,
				<i>heightening,</i> by use of a stronger term, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				<u>Fig.</u>
				2.28
			</span></i>.</div>
